        "executes" : false,
        "heading" : "Anti-Patterns",
        "line" : 42,
        "lines" : [
          "Don't skip the approval wait for a deploy that \"obviously needs\" a",
          "rollback. The approval gate exists so a rollback is a deliberate call,",
          "not an automatic reflex to any unhealthy reading",
          "Don't treat one rollback attempt as sufficient. The retry loop exists",
          "because a rollback can complete without the deploy's health actually",
          "recovering yet"
        ],
        "role" : "reference"
      },
      {
        "executes" : true,
